  "post_content": "<p>El CD Onda &quot;B&quot; ha goleado tambi&eacute;n esta tarde al&nbsp;CD La Llosa&nbsp;por 8-0, en un partido disputado desde las 16 horas en el campo municipal L&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic, de 2&ordf; categor&iacute;a regional de f&uacute;tbol, cuyo grupo 3&ordm; encabeza.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_1227.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Abel ha logrado su &quot;hat-trick&quot;, al conseguir tres goles, y se ha llevado el bal&oacute;n. Nada m&aacute;s comenzar el partido, ha marcado Miguel. Poco despu&eacute;s Abel ha marcado su primer gol, de penalti. y antes del descanso ha conseguido el 3-0.</p>\n<p>En la segunda mitad han marcado dos goles cada uno David Garc&iacute;a y Xuti, para redondear el 8-0 definitivo nuevamente Abel.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1221.jpg\" alt=\"img_1221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1222.jpg\" alt=\"img_1222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1223.jpg\" alt=\"img_1223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1224.jpg\" alt=\"img_1224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1225.jpg\" alt=\"img_1225\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1226.jpg\" alt=\"img_1226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1227.jpg\" alt=\"img_1227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1228.jpg\" alt=\"img_1228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1229.jpg\" alt=\"img_1229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1230.jpg\" alt=\"img_1230\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1231.jpg\" alt=\"img_1231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1232.jpg\" alt=\"img_1232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1233.jpg\" alt=\"img_1233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1234.jpg\" alt=\"img_1234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondabcdlallosa/img_1235.jpg\" alt=\"img_1235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
